      "writtenOn": "2023-06-28T16:37:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is to makes things easier to track and extend in the future.\nAS explained in other comment, we have two stages\"\n\nstage 1: Look at device as separate entity before we know the device has everything to be able to stream\n\nstage 2: When device has everything which enables it to stream, we change the optic to the group.\n\nhaving separate stats will keeps code cleaner and easy to extend if we find other metrics we want to measure for device or the group.",
